        "en": "Panel 4",
        "pt": "Painel 4"
      },
      "time": "13:30 – 14:20",
      "title": {
        "en": "Residential Product: Patrimonial, Multifamily & Architecture",
        "pt": "Produto Residencial: Patrimonial, Multifamily e Arquitetura"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Brazil builds homes to sell and to hold. The US builds them to rent and to operate at institutional scale. Architecture and quality decide whether either kind lasts. This panel looks at what the patrimonial and multifamily models can take from each other.",
        "pt": "O Brasil constrói para vender e guardar. Os EUA constroem para alugar e operar em escala institucional. Arquitetura e qualidade definem se um e outro duram. O painel olha o que os modelos patrimonialista e multifamily têm a aprender entre si."
      },
